{
  "recording_id": "netease:516721459",
  "source": "User-supplied resources/lyrics-spelling/波克比的愛-茄子蛋",
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "line-1",
      "text": "佇學生的時代",
      "spelling": "tī ha̍k-sing ê sî-tāi",
      "source_lines": [
        1,
        2
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-4",
      "text": "我去愛著一個查某",
      "spelling": "guá khì ài-tio̍h tsi̍t ê tsa-bóo",
      "source_lines": [
        4,
        5
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-7",
      "text": "自從做夥了後",
      "spelling": "tsū-tsiông tsò-hué liáu-āu",
      "source_lines": [
        7,
        8
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-10",
      "text": "我是逐天攏感覺很煩惱",
      "spelling": "guá sī ta̍k-kang lóng kám-kak tsiok huân-ló",
      "source_lines": [
        10,
        11
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-13",
      "text": "煩惱東擱煩惱西",
      "spelling": "huân-ló tang koh huân-ló sai",
      "source_lines": [
        13,
        14
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-16",
      "text": "煩惱伊甘會去愛著別人",
      "spelling": "huân-ló i kam-ē khì ài-tio̍h pa̍t-lâng",
      "source_lines": [
        16,
        17
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-19",
      "text": "希望伊會凍",
      "spelling": "hi-bāng i ē-tàng",
      "source_lines": [
        19,
        20
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-22",
      "text": "對那些查埔講妳愛的人是我",
      "spelling": "tuì hia-ê tsa-poo kóng lí ài ê lâng sī guá",
      "source_lines": [
        22,
        23
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-25",
      "text": "佇小漢的時陣",
      "spelling": "tī sè-hàn ê sî-tsūn",
      "source_lines": [
        25,
        26
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-28",
      "text": "我最喜歡咧看卡通",
      "spelling": "guá siōng xǐhuān teh khuànn khah-thong",
      "source_lines": [
        28,
        29
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-31",
      "text": "佇我大漢了後",
      "spelling": "tī guá tuā-hàn liáu-āu",
      "source_lines": [
        31,
        32
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-34",
      "text": "我馬逐天下班返去看卡通",
      "spelling": "guá má ta̍k-kang hā-pan tńg-khì khuànn khah-thong",
      "source_lines": [
        34,
        35
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-37",
      "text": "佇我小漢的時陣",
      "spelling": "tī guá sè-hàn ê sî-tsūn",
      "source_lines": [
        37,
        38
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-40",
      "text": "我攏想欲自己成做電視內底的卡通人物",
      "spelling": "guá lóng siūnn-beh ka-kī tsiânn-tsuè tiān-sī lāi-té ê khah-thong lîn-bu̍t",
      "source_lines": [
        40,
        41
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-43",
      "text": "佇我大漢了後",
      "spelling": "tī guá tuā-hàn liáu-āu",
      "source_lines": [
        43,
        44
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-46",
      "text": "我才知影恁攏看我親像卡通人物",
      "spelling": "guá tsiah tsai-iánn lin lóng khuànn guá tshin-tshiūnn khah-thong lîn-bu̍t",
      "source_lines": [
        46,
        47
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-49",
      "text": "噢 我的愛人啊",
      "spelling": "oh guá ê ài-lîn ah",
      "source_lines": [
        49,
        50
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-52",
      "text": "夢中的妳牽著我的手 夢醒卻當作毋知影",
      "spelling": "bāng-tiong ê lí khan-tio̍h guá ê tshiú bāng tshínn suah tòng-tsuè m̄ tsai-iánn",
      "source_lines": [
        52,
        53
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-55",
      "text": "噢 我的愛人啊",
      "spelling": "oh guá ê ài-lîn ah",
      "source_lines": [
        55,
        56
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-58",
      "text": "沒妳的日子 我親像日頭咧過寒冬",
      "spelling": "bô lí ê li̍t-tsí guá tshin-tshiūnn li̍t-thâu teh kuè hân-tang",
      "source_lines": [
        58,
        59
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-61",
      "text": "無人相信我的話",
      "spelling": "bô-lâng siong-sìn guá ê uē",
      "source_lines": [
        61,
        62
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-64",
      "text": "無人相信我的話",
      "spelling": "bô-lâng siong-sìn guá ê uē",
      "source_lines": [
        64,
        65
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "line-67",
      "text": "無人相信我的話",
      "spelling": "bô-lâng siong-sìn guá ê uē",
      "source_lines": [
        67,
